update content_bodies set title = 'Nara Tourism: A Treasure Trove of Power Spots', description = 'This video serves as a guide for those traveling to Nara Prefecture, highlighting various power spots in the area. Viewers are encouraged to share their own recommendations in the comments if they know of any spots not mentioned in the video. The channel, ''Travel Master,'' aims to provide enjoyable and enriching travel information, covering aspects like sightseeing, transportation, accommodation, and dining. The team behind the channel believes in enhancing life through travel and encourages viewers to explore new possibilities through their journeys. For more information and updates, viewers can follow the official social media accounts.' where id = 'ZHwRYhVcl6K451FHGc5ha';
update content_bodies set title = '瀧本美織｜鹿児島県・曽於市を巡る旅 【旅色Movie】', description = '瀧本美織さんが曽於市で1泊2日の旅を楽しみました。旅の中では、伝説の巨人・弥五郎どんにまつわる神社や、パワースポットとして知られる洞窟などの神秘的なスポットを訪れました。具体的には、「道の駅おおすみ弥五郎伝説の里」で巨像に挨拶し、「黒豚料理やごろう亭」で新鮮な肉を堪能。「フォレストアドベンチャーおおすみ」で自然を冒険し、「愛の里」でリラックス。「溝ノ口洞穴」でパワーをもらい、「Muffin House Suephie」で可愛いスイーツを探し、「焼肉・しゃぶしゃぶ赤坂」で絶品のお肉を楽しみました。' where id = 'PobMF7OHlc03g_xcsxXHE';
update content_bodies set title = 'Miori Takimoto''s Journey in Soo City, Kagoshima Prefecture | Tabiiro Movie', description = 'In this 1-night, 2-day trip, Miori Takimoto explores the mystical spots of Soo City, known for its legendary giant, Yagorodon, and power spots like caves. The journey includes visiting the ''Roadside Station Osumi Yagoroden'' to greet the giant statue, enjoying fresh black pork at ''Yagorotei'', adventuring in nature at ''Forest Adventure Osumi'', relaxing at ''Ai no Sato'', gaining energy at ''Mizokuchi Cave'', searching for cute sweets at ''Muffin House Suephie'', and savoring delicious meat at ''Yakiniku Shabu Shabu Akasaka''.' where id = 'qjhKvb65A-BIESCC1W0E0';
update content_bodies set title = '西野七瀬｜まちに、泊まる【旅色Movie】', description = '宿泊施設だけでなく、その周辺のまちも楽しむ「分散型ホテル」をテーマにした旅ムービーです。西野七瀬さんが熊本県の黒川温泉を散策し、温泉街全体を一つの旅館として捉えています。この映像では、地域の魅力や美しさが紹介されており、宿泊だけでなく地元の観光も楽しむことを提案しています。' where id = 'J3dIuXMy88JDvF0XHizFq';
update content_bodies set title = 'Nanase Nishino | Stay in the Town [Tabiiro Movie]', description = 'This travel movie features a ''distributed hotel'' concept, highlighting not just the accommodation but also the surrounding town. Nanase Nishino explores Kumamoto Prefecture''s Kurokawa Onsen, envisioning the entire hot spring area as a single ryokan. The film showcases the beauty and charm of the area, encouraging viewers to enjoy both the stay and the local attractions.' where id = 'S46kKZmaJzbOlskWYdzvN';
update content_bodies set title = '鹿児島観光では外せない王道（定番）スポット', description = 'この動画は鹿児島県への旅行を計画している方に向けて、訪れるべき定番スポットを紹介しています。動画で紹介されていないおすすめスポットがあれば、ぜひコメント欄でシェアしてください。『旅行の達人』チャンネルは、観光、移動、宿泊、食事など、旅行に関するさまざまな情報を提供し、視聴者の旅行体験を向上させることを目指しています。旅行を通じて人生を豊かにすることを信じており、新しい可能性を探求することを奨励しています。動画では、桜島、長崎鼻、霧島神宮、いおワールドかごしま水族館、屋久島、鹿児島県霧島アートの森、知覧特攻平和会館などのスポットが紹介されています。訪問前には公式サイトで最新情報を確認することをお勧めします。' where id = 'nm_N4buGjy_DGnAZ_e_it';
update content_bodies set title = 'Must-Visit Classic Spots in Kagoshima Tourism', description = 'This video serves as a guide for those traveling to Kagoshima Prefecture, showcasing essential classic spots to visit. If you have any recommendations not mentioned in the video, please share them in the comments. The channel, ''Travel Master,'' aims to enhance your travel experience by providing various travel information, including sightseeing, transportation, accommodation, and dining. The team behind the channel believes in enriching lives through travel and encourages viewers to explore new possibilities. The video highlights several locations, including Sakurajima, Nagasakibana, Kirishima Shrine, Iow World Kagoshima Aquarium, Yakushima, Kirishima Art Forest, and Chiran Peace Museum. Viewers are advised to check official websites for the latest information before visiting.' where id = 'qF-gkQqeuh7GGG9oGQ1ek';
update content_bodies set title = '上白石萌歌｜奥薩摩・伊佐のふわり旅日和 鹿児島県伊佐市 60秒Ver【旅色Movie】', description = '鹿児島県本土の最北地に位置する伊佐市は、川内川をはじめとする清流に囲まれ、美しい自然景観が魅力です。寒暖差が激しい盆地後系で、2020年の最低気温はマイナス6.4℃（12月26日）、最高平均気温は37.6℃（8月18日）と気温差が明確です。この環境が豊かな食文化を育み、「薩摩の米蔵」としても知られています。また、「曽木の滝」と呼ばれる東洋のナイアガラや、5月から9月の間にしか姿を現さない曽木発電所遺構など、歴史的な魅力も詰まった町です。自然、食、カルチャーと多彩な魅力にあふれる伊佐市の旅に出かけてみませんか。' where id = '8dfjTH2cL01HFIVDue7El';
update content_bodies set title = 'Moka Kamishiraishi | A Gentle Journey in Okusatsuma, Isa City, Kagoshima Prefecture 60s Ver【Tabiiro Movie】', description = 'Located in the northernmost part of Kagoshima Prefecture, Isa City is surrounded by clear streams like the Sendai River, showcasing beautiful natural scenery. The region experiences significant temperature variations, with a record low of -6.4°C in December 2020 and an average high of 37.6°C in August. This climate fosters a rich food culture, earning it the nickname ''Satsuma''s Rice Warehouse.'' The city is also home to historical sites such as the ''Sogi Falls,'' known as the ''Niagara of the East,'' and the ''Sogi Power Station Ruins,'' which only appear from May to September. Isa City offers a diverse array of attractions, including nature, food, and culture, inviting travelers to explore its many charms.' where id = 'ufJjKENhKlyrg6y3AUMbX';
update content_bodies set title = '山田杏奈｜神秘の島へ～奄美大島・龍郷町をあるく', description = '2021年7月、奄美大島が世界自然遺産に登録されました。特に龍郷町は穏やかな海に囲まれ、中央に山が連なる自然豊かな町です。山田杏奈さんが奄美大島に初めて上陸し、自然と触れ合いながら奄美の味覚を楽しむ旅に出かけました。動画では、e-bikeに乗って龍郷町を巡り、シュノーケリングで海の魅力を体験し、「奄美自然観察の森」で植物や野鳥を観察しながら森林浴を楽しむ様子が紹介されています。また、地元漁師の店で新鮮な魚介料理を味わい、「La Fonte」でデザートを楽しみ、「大島紬村」で大島紬の着付けや泥染め体験を行う様子も収められています。' where id = 'YzRDA_VVpqvrU7nIbtnDm';
update content_bodies set title = 'Yamada Anna | Journey to the Mysterious Island - Exploring Tatsugo Town, Amami Oshima', description = 'In July 2021, Amami Oshima was registered as a UNESCO World Natural Heritage site. Tatsugo Town, surrounded by calm seas and featuring a central mountain range, is a nature-rich area. Yamada Anna visits Amami Oshima for the first time, embarking on a journey to experience the local nature and savor the island''s culinary delights. The video includes activities such as riding an e-bike through Tatsugo Town, snorkeling to explore the ocean''s beauty, enjoying a forest bath while observing plants and birds at the Amami Nature Observation Forest, tasting fresh seafood at a local fisherman''s restaurant, indulging in desserts at La Fonte, and experiencing traditional Oshima Tsumugi fabric dressing and mud dyeing at Oshima Tsumugi Village.' where id = 'c37i9x18FKyIl4LJ-Wki0';
update content_bodies set title = '【鳥取観光/グルメ】鳥取で味わいたいランチグルメ', description = 'この動画は鳥取県への旅行や観光を考えている方に向けて、鳥取のランチグルメを紹介しています。動画で紹介されていないおすすめの場所があれば、ぜひコメント欄でシェアしてください。チャンネル「旅行の達人」は、観光、移動、宿泊、食事など、旅行をより楽しく快適にする情報を提供しています。メンバーは旅行を通じて人生を豊かにすることを目指しており、視聴者が新しい可能性を発見できるようなきっかけを提供したいと考えています。公式のSNSアカウントをフォローすることで、最新情報を得ることができます。' where id = 'abGtAD91TheBxIqNDCrJl';
update content_bodies set title = 'Tottori Tourism / Gourmet: Lunch Delicacies to Try in Tottori', description = 'This video serves as a guide for those traveling to Tottori Prefecture, showcasing various lunch gourmet options available in the area. Viewers are encouraged to share their own recommendations in the comments if they know of any places not mentioned in the video. The channel, ''Travel Master,'' aims to provide enjoyable and comfortable travel information, covering various aspects such as sightseeing, transportation, accommodation, and dining. The team behind the channel believes in enriching lives through travel and hopes to inspire viewers to discover new possibilities and enhance their experiences. For more information and updates, viewers can follow the official social media accounts.' where id = 'g1d7JhNYKVGWFzR8o7NjY';
