update content_bodies set title = 'Explore the Popular Spots of Meriken Park, a Landmark of Kobe, Hyogo', description = 'This video serves as a guide for those traveling to Hyogo Prefecture, particularly highlighting Meriken Park and its iconic landmarks in Kobe. Viewers are encouraged to share any additional recommendations in the comments. The channel, ''Travel Master,'' aims to provide comprehensive travel information, including sightseeing, transportation, accommodation, and dining, to enhance the travel experience. The team behind the channel believes in enriching lives through travel and aims to inspire viewers to discover new possibilities through their journeys. For more information and updates, viewers can follow the official social media accounts and subscribe to the channel.' where id = 'Da395q7cCgRc25kLAY4xY';
update content_bodies set title = '相武紗季｜私と旅の架け橋！ とっておきを体験する 香川県坂出市へ', description = '女優の相武紗季さんと共に、香川県坂出市での1泊2日の旅を楽しみました。絶景の瀬戸大橋や歴史、地元の美味しいグルメを堪能し、特に「がもううどん」のランチは満足度120％。おせったいの文化が息づくこの町は、日常をリセットし、穏やかに過ごすのにぴったりの場所です。' where id = 'PlP6Sltsqoz9klDewyh4S';
update content_bodies set title = 'Saki Aibu | A Bridge to Travel! Experiencing the Best of Sakaide City, Kagawa Prefecture', description = 'In this 1-night, 2-day journey, actress Saki Aibu explores Sakaide City, enjoying local history, nature, and must-try gourmet food, including the iconic Seto Ohashi Bridge. The town, rich in the culture of ''osettai'' (hospitality), offers a gentle atmosphere perfect for resetting daily life and enjoying a peaceful getaway.' where id = '0v4GZaylwHb7-2UKbErIp';
update content_bodies set title = '箭内夢菜｜遊びと癒やしで満ちる旅 高知・須崎市へ', description = '箭内夢菜さんが訪れたのは、高知県のほぼ真ん中に位置する須崎市です。この市は、海・山・川に囲まれた豊かな自然が魅力で、遊びと癒やしを体験できる場所です。海上アクティビティや山の秘湯、海の幸やジビエなど、さまざまな楽しみが詰まったまちです。' where id = '-JV4em3s3t_rgl_9dSIMh';
update content_bodies set title = 'Yumena Yanai''s Journey Filled with Fun and Healing in Susaki City, Kochi', description = 'Yumena Yanai visited Susaki City, located almost in the center of Kochi Prefecture, surrounded by rich nature including the sea, mountains, and rivers. The city offers a variety of activities for both fun and relaxation, including marine activities, hidden hot springs in the mountains, and a bounty of seafood and game meat. Susaki is a place where visitors can enjoy a wide range of experiences.' where id = 'l1eLXYdZWfk4E42sFFtKX';
update content_bodies set title = '山本美月｜広島県神石高原町への旅 緑と遊ぶネイチャートリップ', description = '広島県東部に位置する神石高原町は、標高500～700mにあり、町の面積の80％以上が森林に覆われている自然豊かな場所です。このユニークな地域では、様々な自然の恵みと美しい緑の風景を楽しむことができます。山本美月さんは、神石高原ティアガルテンでの森林セラピー体験、帝釈峡神龍湖での遊覧船、COHAN CAFEでのスイーツタイム、世界唯一のとよまつ紙ヒコーキ・タワー訪問、光信寺での坐禅体験、道の駅さんわ182ステーションでのお土産探しなど、1泊2日のネイチャートリップを楽しみます。' where id = 'YUybcS0acyuWlIa6RbQCK';
update content_bodies set title = 'Mizuki Yamamoto | Travel to Jinsekikogen Town, Hiroshima Prefecture - Nature Trip with Greenery', description = 'Jinsekikogen Town, located in the eastern part of Hiroshima Prefecture at an elevation of 500 to 700 meters, is blessed with rich nature, with over 80% of its area covered by forests. This unique destination offers a variety of natural treasures and stunning green landscapes. Mizuki Yamamoto embarks on a two-day nature trip, experiencing activities such as forest therapy at the Jinsekikogen Tiagarten, a boat ride on Lake Chikushikyo, enjoying sweets at Cohan Cafe, visiting the world''s only Toyomatsu Paper Airplane Tower, practicing Zen meditation at Koshinji Dojo, and shopping for souvenirs at Sanwa 182 Station.' where id = '6x3qDCvTBRCTd8xOEVmuT';
