update content_bodies set title = '星野真里｜大人のショートトリップ　おしゃれに、厚木へ', description = '日帰り可能な身近な場所でも、新たな発見や心躍る出会いがあり、旅の醍醐味を感じることができます。今回は神奈川県厚木市を訪れ、女優の星野真里さんと共におしゃれなスポットを深掘りします。旅のプランには、厚木グラススタジオでのガラス工芸体験、GrassShop＆Coffee 玻璃舎でのティータイムとショッピング、黄金井酒造での酒蔵見学、タベルナ ラ・メッセでのあつぎ豚ランチ、あつぎ郷土博物館での厚木市の歴史学習、サンクトガーレン タップルームでの旅の締めくくりが含まれています。' where id = 'ZO0eLmY0asKx1gkhD4HWi';
update content_bodies set title = 'Mari Hoshino | Stylish Short Trip to Atsugi', description = 'Even in nearby places that can be visited in a day, there are often new discoveries and exciting encounters that capture the essence of travel. This time, we explore stylish spots in Atsugi City, Kanagawa Prefecture, alongside actress Mari Hoshino, for an adult short trip. The itinerary includes experiences such as glass art at Atsugi Glass Studio, tea time and shopping at GrassShop & Coffee Hali, a sake brewery tour at Koganei Sake Brewery, lunch featuring Atsugi pork at Trattoria La Messe, learning about the history of Atsugi City at the Atsugi Local Museum, and concluding the journey at the Sanktgallen Taproom.' where id = 'SJ38WqEAOJ0dtXjVOT6cj';
