update content_bodies set title = '笛木優子｜食と、文化と、絶景と。山形・西川町で私を整える旅', description = '名峰月山のふもとに広がる西川町は、自然の恵みが豊富です。月山トレッキングで雄大な景色を楽しみ、山菜や川魚、名水仕込みの銘酒を味わうことで、心身ともに浄化されることでしょう。笛木優子さんと共に、ここでしかできない特別な旅に出かけます。' where id = '-pokyjUzubY8UywmZbpwu';
update content_bodies set title = 'Yuko Fueki | A Journey to Refresh Myself with Food, Culture, and Scenic Views in Nishikawa Town, Yamagata', description = 'Nishikawa Town, located at the foot of the majestic Mt. Gassan, is rich in natural blessings. Enjoy breathtaking views while trekking Mt. Gassan, and purify your body and mind by tasting wild vegetables, river fish, and locally brewed sake made with pristine water. Join Yuko Fueki on a unique journey that can only be experienced here.' where id = 'zcYIemYOuI9-OhRvY1Nxv';
