update content_bodies set title = '戸田菜穂｜いい旅はカラフルだ。花のまち・恵庭の彩りを巡る【旅色Movie】', description = '恵庭市は、空と陸のアクセスに恵まれ、恵庭岳の裾野に広がる自然環境が豊かです。現在は“花のまち”として知られ、道内屈指の花苗の産地でもあります。俳優の戸田菜穂さんと共に、四季折々のカラフルな花々に彩られた恵庭市を旅します。旅の中では、花やグルメ、観光、体験など、さまざまなワクワクが待っています。' where id = 'CqjP4fHDPLmUGpzklGa9A';
update content_bodies set title = 'Naho Toda | A Colorful Journey in Eniwa, the City of Flowers【Tabiiro Movie】', description = 'Eniwa City, blessed with excellent access by air and land, is surrounded by the rich natural environment of Eniwa-dake. Known as the ''City of Flowers,'' it is one of Hokkaido''s leading producers of flower seedlings. Join actress Naho Toda on a journey through Eniwa City, which is adorned with colorful flowers throughout the year. The trip is filled with excitement, featuring flowers, gourmet food, sightseeing, and various experiences.' where id = 'CWxTMlcPe37JCCuBV4_sU';
