update content_bodies set title = 'Top 7 Must-Visit Spots in Shodoshima, Kagawa', description = 'This video serves as a guide for travelers visiting Kagawa Prefecture, specifically highlighting famous tourist attractions in Shodoshima. If you have any additional recommendations not mentioned in the video, feel free to share them in the comments. The channel, ''Travel Master,'' aims to enhance your travel experience by providing a wealth of information on sightseeing, transportation, accommodation, and dining, both domestically and internationally. The team behind the channel believes in enriching lives through travel and encourages viewers to explore new possibilities and experiences. For more information and updates, you can follow their official social media accounts.' where id = 'HjI5vA_AkHRX75VUkwPrt';
update content_bodies set title = '島根の絶景 イメージ編', description = '悠久の歴史と文化が息づく島根。懐かしく美しい日本の原風景を高精細な４Ｋ映像で体験できます。本物に出会う旅へ、さあ島根へ。島根の魅力を約５分間に凝縮した映像をお楽しみください。' where id = '7Qb67WioPwvVAOV-YBWe0';
update content_bodies set title = 'Stunning Scenery of Shimane - Image Edition', description = 'Shimane is a place where ancient history and culture still thrive. Experience the nostalgic and beautiful landscapes of Japan through high-definition 4K visuals. Embark on a journey to encounter the real essence of Shimane. This video condenses the charm of Shimane into approximately five minutes of captivating footage.' where id = 'lO7uZRlvnPK1iim-3SDUa';
update content_bodies set title = '大垣市観光PR　「四季」 篇', description = '上田定行さんのナレーションによる観光PR動画で、大垣の自然、歴史、文化などの魅力を紹介しています。大垣市は岐阜県西部に位置し、人口16万人を有し、「水の都」として知られています。松尾芭蕉の紀行文「奥の細道」の終着地であり、関ケ原合戦では石田三成の本拠地となった大垣城や、豊臣秀吉が一夜で築いた墨俣一夜城などの歴史的な名所があります。3月下旬から5月には舟下りやたらい舟、大垣まつりなどのイベントが開催され、多くの観光客で賑わいます。' where id = 'cX5UFy-cTHMeU_Ziq4Jbq';
update content_bodies set title = 'Ogaki City Tourism PR: ''Four Seasons''', description = 'This is a tourism PR video narrated by Sadaaki Ueda. The video introduces various attractions of Ogaki, including its nature, history, and culture. Ogaki is located in the western part of Gifu Prefecture, known as the ''Water City'' due to its abundant underground water. With a population of 160,000, it is historically significant as the endpoint of Matsuo Basho''s travelogue ''The Narrow Road to the Deep North'' and was the base for Ishida Mitsunari during the Battle of Sekigahara. Notable sites include Ogaki Castle and the Suimon Castle, said to be built by Toyotomi Hideyoshi in one night. From late March to May, the city hosts various events, including boat rides and the UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage-listed Ogaki Festival, attracting many tourists.' where id = 'wZTxZCb-19MaydFKwkZno';
update content_bodies set title = '大阪/グルメ: 串カツを食べつくそう！', description = 'この動画は、大阪府への旅行や観光を考えている方に向けて、地元の人にも人気の美味しい串カツが楽しめるお店を7軒紹介しています。動画で紹介されていないおすすめの店があれば、ぜひコメント欄でシェアしてください。また、旅行の達人の公式LINEアカウントでは、賢くお得に旅行する方法を随時配信しています。このチャンネルは、観光、移動、宿泊、食事など、旅行に関するさまざまな情報を提供し、旅行を通じて人生を豊かにすることを目指しています。' where id = '221Bcs8rFIuDCeFwuXZs2';
