update content_bodies set title = 'Yoshinogari Historical Park: More Than Just Ruins!', description = 'This video introduces the attractions of Yoshinogari Historical Park in Saga Prefecture, which is home to the Yoshinogari ruins. It serves as a guide for those planning to travel or visit Saga. The video encourages viewers to share any additional recommendations in the comments. The channel, ''Travel Master,'' aims to provide enjoyable travel information, covering various aspects such as sightseeing, transportation, accommodation, and dining. The mission is to enrich lives through travel, helping people discover new possibilities and experiences. The video also includes details about the park''s location, access, and nearby dining options.' where id = 'beJ6VyL0otVKxQyAN6cxY';
update content_bodies set title = '【日本最大級】絶叫！ジップライン', description = 'ダニエラとプリスカはアイマスクをされて「ツリーピクニックアドベンチャーいけだ」に向かいます。高所恐怖症のプリスカは、日本最大級のジップラインに挑戦することができるのでしょうか？「プリーズヘルプミー！」と叫ぶプリスカに何が起こるのか、興味がそそられます。「ツリーピクニックアドベンチャーいけだ」では、鳥のように絶景を楽しむことができ、チャレンジャーを待っています。現在はコロナウイルスの影響で県外への旅行が難しい状況ですが、落ち着いた際にはぜひ福井を訪れてください。' where id = 'GxV3c5RdrAFTCE_-PiW9U';
update content_bodies set title = 'Japan''s Largest Thrill! Zipline', description = 'Danira and Priska, blindfolded, head to a thrilling adventure at ''Tree Picnic Adventure Ikeda,'' where Priska, who has a fear of heights, faces Japan''s largest zipline. What happens when she shouts, ''Please help me!''? At ''Tree Picnic Adventure Ikeda,'' visitors can enjoy breathtaking views as if they were birds. Although travel and tourism outside the prefecture are currently challenging due to the COVID-19 pandemic, we hope you will visit Fukui when things settle down!' where id = '6NwtQhdOy9L7mQCARbX2t';
