update content_bodies set title = 'Four Ways to Enjoy Mt. Bizan, the Symbol of Tokushima City!', description = 'This video serves as a guide for those traveling to Tokushima Prefecture, specifically highlighting Mt. Bizan, a popular tourist spot in Tokushima City, the capital of the prefecture. The video outlines various ways to enjoy the mountain, including access methods, scenic views, and nearby attractions. Viewers are encouraged to share their own recommendations in the comments. The channel, ''Travel Master,'' aims to provide enjoyable travel information, helping viewers enhance their travel experiences. It also offers promotional opportunities for local tourism businesses. For more travel tips and updates, viewers can follow the channel''s official social media accounts.' where id = 'uH8N-OeVyoeJTCamxD8oB';
update content_bodies set title = '【武商吹部 ver.】福井県民下手ラップ『きてみね～の！』', description = '福井県民の魅力を歌ってPRするミュージックビデオ「下手ラップ」に、福井県立武生商業・商工高等学校吹奏楽部が登場します。この吹奏楽部は、全国大会に7回出場した北陸代表であり、「日本一ファンキーなバンド」として注目されています。彼らの躍動感あふれるパフォーマンスで、下手ラップが盛り上がります。「ふっく〜い　きてみね〜の！」という忘れられないフレーズで、心を込めて「FUKUI」を届けます。現在はコロナウイルスの影響で県外への旅行が難しいですが、落ち着いた際にはぜひ福井にお越しください。' where id = 'CRpu55_2ocuHAq44a4Ml6';
update content_bodies set title = 'Fukui Prefectural Takefu Commercial and Industrial High School Brass Band''s Local Rap ''Kitemine-no!''', description = 'The music video ''Local Rap'' promotes the charm of Fukui, featuring the Fukui Prefectural Takefu Commercial and Industrial High School Brass Band. This band, representing the Hokuriku region, has participated in the national competition seven times and is known as ''the funkiest band in Japan.'' Their dynamic performance enhances the rap, making it unforgettable with the catchy phrase ''Fukui, Kitemine-no!'' They invite everyone to sing and dance along. Although travel and tourism outside the prefecture are currently challenging due to the COVID-19 pandemic, they encourage visitors to come to Fukui when the situation stabilizes.' where id = 'BnPYSBpa6H7561dacCkBX';
