update content_bodies set title = '【岐阜県大垣市ＰＲ動画】女性モデルYUが行く岐阜県大垣市バイクツーリング映像', description = 'この観光プロモーション映像では、女性モデルのYUさんが岐阜県大垣市の壮大な自然の中で地元の人々と交流しながら、TRIUMPHのバイクでツーリングを楽しむ様子が描かれています。映像には、大垣城、奥の細道むすびの地記念館、住吉橋、三輪酒造、CAFEあめんぼ、カフェレストラン華ひびき、水嶺湖などの観光スポットが登場します。大垣市は岐阜県西部に位置し、人口16万人を有し、豊富な地下水に恵まれた「水の都」として知られています。また、松尾芭蕉の紀行文「奥の細道」のむすびの地であり、関ケ原合戦の際には西軍の本拠地でもありました。3月下旬から5月には舟下りや大垣まつりが開催され、多くの観光客で賑わいます。' where id = 'tCvG0lshl4eluw308v29I';
update content_bodies set title = 'Gifu Prefecture Ogaki City PR Video: Female Model YU Goes on a Motorcycle Tour', description = 'This promotional video showcases female model YU enjoying a motorcycle tour in Ogaki City, Gifu Prefecture, while interacting with local residents amidst the city''s magnificent natural scenery. The video features various tourist spots, including Ogaki Castle, the Oku no Hosomichi Musubi no Chi Memorial Museum, Sumiyoshi Bridge, Miwa Sake Brewery, CAFE Amenbo, Cafe Restaurant Hana Hibiki, and Mizumine Lake. Ogaki City, located in the western part of Gifu Prefecture, is known for its rich underground water and has a population of 160,000. It is historically significant as the endpoint of Matsuo Basho''s travelogue ''Oku no Hosomichi'' and was the base for Ishida Mitsunari during the Battle of Sekigahara. The city hosts various cultural events, including boat rides and the UNESCO-listed Ogaki Festival, attracting many tourists from late March to May.' where id = 'tQ7cgK5BsB5BkAh8VSkS2';
